Pokémon Trades help you connect with
the world!{VAR BE00}
The world will be bigger!{VAR BE01}
If you trade Pokémon with many people,
you will be happy!{VAR BE01}
Because I will give you something good!{VAR BE01}
So, Trainer, have you traded Pokémon
with many people?

Hello, Trainer!{VAR BE01}
Have you traded Pokémon with
many people?

Oh, wonderful.{VAR BE01}
Then, let me check how many people you
have traded Pokémon with.{VAR BE01}

Please trade Pokémon with many people!{VAR BE01}
I will give you a present if you do.
Besides, it's fun!

What are the Pokémon that I traded
doing now?{VAR BE01}
What are the people who traded with me
thinking about now?{VAR BE01}
Thinking about those things
makes me happy!
